node_modules/
.env
*.log
.claude/

# Disposable scratch run directories cde/test/*.test.js creates under cde/runs/ (test-*, never
# the real run-2026-... directories). These were always meant to be as invisible to git as
# node_modules/ above — on a genuinely clean checkout, leaving them untracked made a frozen
# idempotency test's own working-tree-cleanliness check see the tree as "dirty" the second time
# it ran (once its own first-run scratch output existed), producing two different manifest
# hashes for what should be an identical, deterministic manifest. See REPRODUCIBILITY.md.
cde/runs/test-*/

# Internal drafting/prep material for actions taken outside the repo
# (posting, recording, filling the submission form) — kept locally, not published.
/SUBMISSION.md
/VIDEO_SCRIPT.md
/X_POST.md
